{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/low-back-pain/","title":"요통의 한의학적 임상 추론","language":"ko-KR","description":"요통을 급만성·통증양상·어혈·풍한습비·허손으로 구분하고 침구·독활기생탕·현대근거로 연결합니다.","text":"요통의 한의학적 임상 추론\n1. 먼저 보는 것\n통증 위치·발병 시점·움직임과의 관계·하지 증상·기능 제한 등을 살핀다.\n2. 변증\n요통\n├─ 고정·오래된 통증 → 어혈 고려\n├─ 냉·습과 연동 → 풍한습비\n└─ 만성 + 허약 → 간신·기혈허\n3. 치료\n국소·경락 치료:\n- 침\n- 약침\n- 전침\n- 부항\n경혈:\n- 신수 BL23\n- 위중 BL40\n방제:\n→ 독활기생탕\n→ 요통 근거 카드","headings":[{"level":2,"title":"1. 먼저 보는 것","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/low-back-pain/#1"},{"level":2,"title":"2. 변증","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/low-back-pain/#2"},{"level":2,"title":"3. 치료","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/clinical-reasoning/low-back-pain/#3"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/bl23/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/bl40/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/authority/low-back-pain/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/duhuo-jisheng-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/acupuncture/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/cupping/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/electroacupuncture/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/pharmacopuncture/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","last_reviewed":"2026-08-19"}
